{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001827090","cik":"0001827090","slug":"certara-827090","name":"Certara, Inc.","ticker":"CERT","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Services-Prepackaged Software","sic":"7372","country":"PA","website":"","listed_years":5.4,"first_annual":"2021-03-15","last_filing":"2026-07-17","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001827090&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Certara, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Prepackaged Software\", based in PA, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $422.1m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 0.9% against the same quarter a year earlier.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($43.3m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $43.3m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-2.2% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue grew only 0.9% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-4.0% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $11.9m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.6% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000214391526000002/0002143915-26-000002-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -14.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-0.14,"consecutive":2,"current":0.009,"current_display":"0.9%","threshold_display":"-14.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 10.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.1,"consecutive":1,"current":-0.022,"current_display":"-2.2%","threshold_display":"10.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Share count growth above this rate transfers your stake to new holders faster than the busine